## Status

Self-excluded: **no verified public benchmark numbers** were found for the exact model/ID `kimi-k2.5` / `moonshotai/Kimi-K2.5` in accessible sources at time of research.

## Research notes

- Accessible metadata (not benchmark scores): Artificial Analysis lists Kimi K2.5 (Reasoning) as an open-weights Kimi reasoning model (released January 2026, deprecated in AA view with suggestion to consider Kimi K2.6), with 1T total / 32B active parameters, Modified MIT License, 256k context, text/image/video input and text output, and pricing around $0.60/$3.00 per 1M tokens (cache discount 83%) in AA snapshots. Open-weight distribution referenced on Hugging Face (`moonshotai/Kimi-K2.5`, per AA).
- Artificial Analysis reported Intelligence Index and task-level benchmark aggregates as unavailable/N/A in the fetched snapshot; no standalone verified benchmark scores (e.g. GPQA, SWE-bench, HLE, MMMU, Terminal-Bench, etc.) for this exact model/ID were found in accessible sources.
- Per `model-report-TEMPLATE.md`: if zero verified public benchmark numbers are found for the exact model/ID, save a notes-only `.md.excluded` file and do not invent placeholder scores.

